{"id":"27379d707b2b9345","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-cor-godel-second.md","title":"Gödel's Second Incompleteness","display":"cor-godel-second — Gödel's Second Incompleteness","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-godel-second","aliases":["58-cor-godel-second"],"display":"cor-godel-second — Gödel's Second Incompleteness","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-consistency.md]]","[[../batch07/58-lem-gg.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-logic.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-contradiction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-godel-second"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-godel-second</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-godel-second — Gödel's Second Incompleteness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6996aaff4caeacce\" href=\"?note=6996aaff4caeacce\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-consistency.md\">../batch13/58-df-consistency.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"967fd715c999aad8\" href=\"?note=967fd715c999aad8\" title=\"../batch07/58-lem-gg.md\">../batch07/58-lem-gg.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e26933a629751c0c\" href=\"?note=e26933a629751c0c\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md\">../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9a0694465b3fed7d\" href=\"?note=9a0694465b3fed7d\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions.md\">../batch11/58-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-logic.md\">../batch17/58-df-logic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a25ca28a0f14be03\" href=\"?note=a25ca28a0f14be03\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-contradiction.md\">../batch04/58-df-contradiction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\Sigma,Q_\\Sigma,g,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm H},\\bot,c\\in V\">\\(T,\\Sigma,Q_\\Sigma,g,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm H},\\bot,c\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffectiveTheory}_S(T,\\Sigma,g)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffectiveTheory}_S(T,\\Sigma,g)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_\\Sigma\\subseteq T\">\\(Q_\\Sigma\\subseteq T\\)</span> 分别给出可枚举公理编码和 Robinson arithmetic 强度（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"967fd715c999aad8\" href=\"?note=967fd715c999aad8\" title=\"../batch07/58-lem-gg.md\">../batch07/58-lem-gg.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\Sigma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumeralMap}_S(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{NumeralMap}_S(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma)\\)</span>（Gödel 编码及数码映射，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"967fd715c999aad8\" href=\"?note=967fd715c999aad8\" title=\"../batch07/58-lem-gg.md\">../batch07/58-lem-gg.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}_T\\)</span>（与同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\Sigma,g,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm H}\">\\(T,\\Sigma,g,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm H}\\)</span> 相联的对象语言可证性谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e26933a629751c0c\" href=\"?note=e26933a629751c0c\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md\">../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}_S(T,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}_S(T,\\Sigma)\\)</span>（该可证性谓词的 Hilbert–Bernays 推导条件，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9a0694465b3fed7d\" href=\"?note=9a0694465b3fed7d\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions.md\">../batch11/58-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S(T,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm H},\\Sigma,\\bot)\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S(T,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm H},\\Sigma,\\bot)\\)</span>（外部句法一致性，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"6996aaff4caeacce\" href=\"?note=6996aaff4caeacce\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-consistency.md\">../batch13/58-df-consistency.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S(\\bot,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S(\\bot,\\Sigma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>（矛盾式谓词与句子集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConSentence}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ConSentence}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>（内部一致性句子的关系，定义于此）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConSentence}_S(c,T,\\Sigma,g,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\bot)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{NumeralMap}_S(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S(\\bot,\\Sigma)\n\\land c\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land c=\\neg\\mathrm{Bew}_T\\!\\left(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma(g(\\bot))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConSentence}_S(c,T,\\Sigma,g,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\bot)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{NumeralMap}_S(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S(\\bot,\\Sigma)\n\\land c\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land c=\\neg\\mathrm{Bew}_T\\!\\left(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma(g(\\bot))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}godel-second}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EffectiveTheory}_S(T,\\Sigma,g)\n\\land Q_\\Sigma\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{HB}_S(T,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S(T,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm H},\\Sigma,\\bot)\n\\land\\mathrm{ConSentence}_S(c,T,\\Sigma,g,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\bot)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;T\\nvdash c.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}godel-second}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EffectiveTheory}_S(T,\\Sigma,g)\n\\land Q_\\Sigma\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{HB}_S(T,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S(T,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm H},\\Sigma,\\bot)\n\\land\\mathrm{ConSentence}_S(c,T,\\Sigma,g,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\bot)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;T\\nvdash c.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The conclusion concerns the formula <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=\\neg\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\">\\(c=\\neg\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\\)</span> inside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>, while <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S(T,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm H},\\Sigma,\\bot)\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S(T,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm H},\\Sigma,\\bot)\\)</span> is the external assertion that no proof object for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> exists.</li>\n<li>All suppressed parameters in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}_T\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash-\">\\(T\\vdash-\\)</span> are required to be the displayed common Gödel numbering, numeral map, and Hilbert proof context.</li>\n<li>Effective axiomatizability, the explicit arithmetic subtheory <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_\\Sigma\">\\(Q_\\Sigma\\)</span>, and the Hilbert–Bernays conditions replace the former undefined predicates “recursively axiomatized” and “sufficiently strong.”</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-consistency.md","status":"resolved","id":"6996aaff4caeacce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-consistency.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-lem-gg.md","status":"resolved","id":"967fd715c999aad8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-lem-gg.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md","status":"resolved","id":"e26933a629751c0c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions.md","status":"resolved","id":"9a0694465b3fed7d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-logic.md","status":"resolved","id":"44e32f3fb4334e0c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-logic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-contradiction.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25ca28a0f14be03","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-contradiction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-lem-gg.md","status":"resolved","id":"967fd715c999aad8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EffectiveTheory}_S(T,\\Sigma,g)$ 与 $Q_\\Sigma\\subseteq T$ 分别给出可枚举公理编码和 Robinson arithmetic 强度（见 [[../batch07/58-lem-gg.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-lem-gg.md","status":"resolved","id":"967fd715c999aad8","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\Sigma)$ 与 $\\mathrm{NumeralMap}_S(\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\Sigma)$（Gödel 编码及数码映射，见 [[../batch07/58-lem-gg.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md","status":"resolved","id":"e26933a629751c0c","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bew}_T$（与同一个 $T,\\Sigma,g,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm H}$ 相联的对象语言可证性谓词，见 [[../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions.md","status":"resolved","id":"9a0694465b3fed7d","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HB}_S(T,\\Sigma)$（该可证性谓词的 Hilbert–Bernays 推导条件，见 [[../batch11/58-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-consistency.md","status":"resolved","id":"6996aaff4caeacce","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S(T,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm H},\\Sigma,\\bot)$（外部句法一致性，见 [[../batch13/58-df-consistency.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,\\Sigma,Q_\\Sigma,g,\\operatorname{Num}_\\Sigma,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm H},\\bot,c\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffectiveTheory}_S(T,\\Sigma,g)","display":fals